#     and device/user data. Never commit. Kept locally only. ===
backup/

# === Build output ===
**/.glyphix-work/

# === Stray screen captures / photos at the repo root ===
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.png

# === Firmware images and raw flash dumps (never commit) ===
*.fw
*.ota.bin
ref_fw*/

